  "title": "Call for Proposals by March 18! Community-Sourced Omics Training Module Content",
  "bodyHtml": "<p><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(20, 20, 21);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">The Common Fund Data Ecosystem (CFDE) Training Center is excited to announce the release of a Request for Proposal (RFP) for the development of&nbsp; </span><strong style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(20, 20, 21);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:bolder;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Community-Sourced Omics Training Module Content</strong><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(20, 20, 21);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">. This initiative seeks to expand the scope of CFDE training offerings by inviting proposals to create high-quality, accessible, and collaborative training module content that leverages CFDE resources and datasets.&nbsp;Refer to </span><a style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0, 120, 174);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration:underline 0.0625rem;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;text-underline-offset:0px;text-underline-position:under;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\" href=\"https://orau.org/cfde-trainingcenter/files/rfp_community-sourced-training-module-content_cfde-training-center.pdf\">PDF</a><span style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);color:rgb(20, 20, 21);display:inline !important;float:none;font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"> for full details about this RFP.</span></p><h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(49, 80, 143);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.34rem;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Key Details:</h4><ul style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(20, 20, 21);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0.25em;orphans:2;padding-left:2ch;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\">Submission Deadline:</strong>&nbsp;March 18, 2026, 11:59 p.m. Pacific Standard Time</li><li style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\">Funding Amount:</strong>&nbsp;Up to $5,000 per selected applicant (anticipated up to six awards)</li><li style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\">Project Period:</strong>&nbsp;April 13, 2026 – August 14, 2026</li><li style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\">Eligibility:</strong>&nbsp;Open to trainers, educators, researchers, and practitioners with expertise in omics-related fields, including graduate students and postdocs.</li></ul><h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(49, 80, 143);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.34rem;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\">Proposal Focus Areas:</strong></h4><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(20, 20, 21);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0.25em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Proposals must align with CFDE principles and highlight at least two CFDE datasets within omics-related areas such as:</p><ul style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(20, 20, 21);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;orphans:2;padding-left:2ch;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><li style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;\">Spatial Omics</li><li style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;\">Multi-Omics</li><li style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;\">Single-Cell Omics</li><li style=\"box-sizing:inherit;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;\">Genomics, Proteomics, Metabolomics, and more</li></ul><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(20, 20, 21);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Selected applicants will receive funding and access to CFDE resources and data to support training content development. For the purposes of this Request for Proposal,&nbsp;proposed&nbsp;training module&nbsp;content may&nbsp;include&nbsp;lessons,&nbsp;microlearnings,&nbsp;mini lessons,&nbsp;case studies,&nbsp;code notebooks,&nbsp;etc.&nbsp;Training module&nbsp;content&nbsp;will&nbsp;ultimately reside&nbsp;on&nbsp;a virtual learning platform, the <a style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0, 120, 174);text-decoration:underline 0.0625rem;text-underline-offset:0px;text-underline-position:under;\" href=\"https://orau.org/cfde-trainingcenter/training/e-learning.html\">CFDE Training Center e-Learning Dashboard</a>.&nbsp;</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(20, 20, 21);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">We encourage eligible individuals and teams to seize this opportunity to contribute to advancing omics education and knowledge dissemination within the scientific community.</p><h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(49, 80, 143);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.34rem;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\">Questions?</strong></h4><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(20, 20, 21);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:0.25em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Contact the CFDE Training Center staff at&nbsp; <a style=\"box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(0, 120, 174);text-decoration:underline 0.0625rem;text-underline-offset:0px;text-underline-position:under;\" href=\"mailto:cfde-trainingcenter@orau.org\">cfde-trainingcenter@orau.org</a>.</p><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(20, 20, 21);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">Thank you for your interest and support in enhancing CFDE’s training resources. We look forward to your thoughtful proposals!</p><h4 style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(49, 80, 143);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:1.34rem;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\"><a href=\"https://orausurvey.orau.org/n/communitymodulecontent.aspx\"><strong style=\"box-sizing:inherit;font-size:inherit;font-weight:bolder;\">Apply Now!</strong></a></h4><p style=\"-webkit-text-stroke-width:0px;background-color:rgb(255, 255, 255);box-sizing:inherit;color:rgb(20, 20, 21);font-family:&quot;Source Sans Pro Web&quot;, &quot;Helvetica Neue&quot;, Helvetica, Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;font-size:16.96px;font-style:normal;font-variant-caps:normal;font-variant-ligatures:normal;font-weight:400;letter-spacing:normal;margin-bottom:0px;margin-top:1em;orphans:2;text-align:start;text-decoration-color:initial;text-decoration-style:initial;text-decoration-thickness:initial;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;widows:2;word-spacing:0px;\">&nbsp;</p>",
